OL,3,GNEWSATrains diverted onto rail line    
OL,4,Aunused over dispute                    
OL,6,FPassengers on trains diverted due to   
OL,7,Fengineering works are set to use part  
OL,8,Fof the East West Rail line, almost two 
OL,9,Fyears after a trade union dispute      
OL,10,Fstalled its opening.                   
OL,12,FRegular trains with fare-paying        
OL,13,Fpassengers on board are yet to use the 
OL,14,Fline between Oxford and Milton Keynes  
OL,15,Fbecause of an ongoing disagreement over
OL,16,Fwhether the operator, Chiltern         
OL,17,FRailways, will employ guards on the    
OL,18,Froute.                                 
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
