OL,3,GNEWSATrains diverted onto rail line    
OL,4,Aunused over dispute                    
OL,6,FGreat Western Railway (GWR) trains on  
OL,7,Fdiversion between South Wales, Bristol 
OL,8,Fand London will use the line while     
OL,9,Fengineering works take place in the    
OL,10,Fcapital at the weekend.                
OL,12,FIt warned the weekend closures would   
OL,13,Faffect all train services to and from  
OL,14,FLondon Paddington, with journeys taking
OL,15,Flonger than usual.                     
